Usage: gccli wellness menstrual-log set <date> [flags]

Change the menstrual daily log of a date. Other fields keep their values.

Arguments:
  <date>    Date of the log (YYYY-MM-DD, today, yesterday, 3d, +30d).

Flags:
  -h, --help                       Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                       Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                      Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header                     Print the column names as the first line of
                                   --plain output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"               Color mode: auto, always, never
                                   ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING             Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"               Unit system for distances, speeds, paces
                                   and elevations in table and plain output:
                                   auto (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us,
                                   statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version                    Print version information.

      --flow=FLOW                  Flow: light, medium or heavy. An empty value
                                   clears it.
      --symptoms=SYMPTOM,...       Comma-separated symptoms: acne, backache,
                                   bloating, body-aches, constipation, cramps,
                                   cravings, diarrhea, dizziness, fatigue,
                                   headache, insomnia, nausea, tender-breasts.
                                   An empty value clears them.
      --moods=MOOD,...             Comma-separated moods: energetic, emotional,
                                   fine, frustrated, happy, irritable,
                                   mood-swings, motivated, overwhelmed, sad.
                                   An empty value clears them.
      --discharge=DISCHARGE,...    Comma-separated discharge: creamy, egg-white,
                                   no-discharge, spotting, sticky, unusual.
                                   no-discharge takes no other value. An empty
                                   value clears it.
      --sex-drive=LEVEL            Sex drive: average, high or low. An empty
                                   value clears it.
      --sexual-activity=KIND       Sexual activity: protected or unprotected.
                                   An empty value clears it.
      --notes=TEXT                 Notes. An empty value clears them.
      --[no-]ovulation             Mark the day as the ovulation day.
                                   --no-ovulation removes the mark.

